<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces continue advancing in Tigray while militia attacks near the Ethiopia-Kenya border have killed civilians and displaced thousands, pushing refugee numbers in Kenya above 50,000. Ethiopian drones are operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Ethiopia blames Egypt and Eritrea for supporting Tigray attacks, and Eritrean forces have carried out drone and artillery strikes near Badme. Heavy weapon clashes have spread on the Oromia-Somali border to Mieso and Afdem, and fighting in Moyale deepens a territorial dispute. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5VUzBzZDdGOTFaZDRVZUdGRVpobjd6UUxsTnZOWFRuZVVCSEtvcUIxdnR6SU9xb3JQYlVFR3dmbDVuYVoyVld3VG1aYmpfZU5SSUN0dzgzQV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNbUIwckN1Nmg3VllKNVBZRU1HYzljVGVPSzRnTnphUU9xLWxIQnA4SnB3ejlPQkM1UkRtRzgzX082QVFmU2FKVGlMUUVyUnptMTVsTXJQMjY1c3dPNF8zUUVsSXYwdFF5amF2bmtlUHpCenYyM2dRRkF2WjZTVV9uTFgtakNkSUl0SjBxck5fVDZsa3NQeHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNclVpbmJnQ3VVVGVhNE55bTU1QmpGenFya2lLMXlrbDFLbW1qTU5iWDJkWV9oVXFVblJaY05ud0p3TnkwTlEwalZaazViOWI0OXNIOGhoMUxDdVp0WnRTREQwNHZLRUJyZGtoVWpWTG5tejFsVGR1T0JBV29tZDFKR2ZyeG1zTTNEMGZ3MTY3dEtVTloxdlc2MDlZaElRdm5qb0YwQk1Ka28zNkZleUFMdjdfTGh0M3N4UmxrZS1B?oc=5&quot;&gt;Addis Standard&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr